                                                <!-- VIEW 2: Compare — configure 1 to 5 independent report configurations.
                                                     Each config card below owns its OWN filters (never shared with any
                                                     other config or with the main Builder) and is submitted through
                                                     /api/reports/comparison/multi/* — the existing N-way engine. -->
